 ## Background
-Ray-marched shadows were popularized in the context of Signed Distance Field (SDF) ray marching for real-time graphics. The technique is described in "GPU Ray Marching of Distance Fields" (DTU, 2011) as Algorithm 3.2, attributed to IQ (Inigo Quilez) [S7, S10, unofficial]. It is a standard component of SDF-based renderers, often cited alongside basic sphere tracing [S1, S9, unofficial].
